   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **With My Own Bare Hands** (1 review): The reviewer specifically praised the energetic delivery of this particular track during the set [5]\n- **Laura** (1 review): The nineteen-minute duration of the track suggests high energy rather than uninspired performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2008-07-08.mk4** (recommended): source not stated; 31 songs; 172 min; rated 4.25/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: Excellent sound quality makes the listener feel as if they were present at the venue [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The audience appeared unenthusiastic during the performance, though the reviewer later retracted their negative assessment [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2008-07-08.mk4**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: FOB slight ROC Schoeps mk4 (DIN) > kc5 > cmc6 > Lunatec V2 > Sound Devices 702 @24/48 [1]. Also: The reviewer plans to upload their own recording captured with AKG microphones and an R4 recorder [4]",
